 AskForStringWithLargeQuestion;parms;question
 parms←##.APLGUI.Request.CreateParmsForString
 parms.default←'Johnny Doe'
 question←''
 question,←⊂'Make sure you understand the request!'
 question,←⊂'This is a very very very very long line that defines the widths of the form'
 question,←⊂'Your full name:'
 question,←⊂''
 question,←⍕¨⍳10
 ⎕←parms ##.APLGUI.Request.AskForString question
⍝Done
